/**
 * The closed tagged union `benchmark/grounding.ts` reads and writes: the Tangle-authored fixture (the analytic oracle — sources, versions, elements, chunks, questions, material claims with closed matching predicates, the scripted per-question supply trace, scripted predicted answers, and the six separately-held RFC 9110 questions) and the keyless grounding report (registration, source manifest, the scorer's oracle gate, one scored scenario per scripted answer with its complete evidence trace and one terminal outcome per visible citation, reconciled counts, and a decision that cannot claim product adoption from a keyless run). TypeScript is generated from this document by `@jarenjs/emit`; the arithmetic an honest report depends on binds here through `$query` at validation time. Every object closes its properties, so key material or an undeclared member cannot be carried.
 */
export type Grounding = GroundingFixture | GroundingReport | GroundingLive | GroundingWeb | GroundingHandoff;

